  "batch": "90e2163a-9d2e-4f22-8354-58eb8b4ffdaf",
  "caveats": "Each ZIP download contains the original scanned TIFF files for a single calendar\nyear, including monthly and dekadal scans. The files are provided in a ZIP archive\nto preserve the original sources and may be extracted and converted as needed.\n\n\nAs a gauge-based product, its accuracy is lower in regions with sparse station density\n(e.g., parts of the Sahara or the Congo Basin). There is typically a latency period\nfor the final quality-controlled product, though \"First Guess\" or \"Monitoring\" versions\nmay be available sooner.",
